      },
      "text": "1. THERMAL EXPANSION (~40% of observed SLR):\n    Ocean warms → water expands in volume (steric SLR)\n    Already committed: ocean continues warming for centuries\n    even if atmospheric warming stops (thermal lag)\n    Current contribution: ~1.5 mm/year"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-IMPACTS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "05-IMPACTS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:climate-science:05-impacts, git-history:climate-science:05-impacts]",
