        "root_concepts": "[impacts]",
        "section": "climate-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Climate Impacts",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. ICE MASS LOSS (~60% of observed SLR):\n    Greenland Ice Sheet: surface melt + calving\n    West Antarctic Ice Sheet: basal melt (warm water underneath)\n    Mountain glaciers: melting worldwide\n    Current contribution: ~2.2 mm/year combined"
    },
    {
