      "text": "COMMITTED SLR:\n    Already locked in from current atmospheric CO₂:\n    ~0.5m SLR above current by 2100 even under aggressive mitigation\n    (thermal expansion continues for centuries; ice sheets slow to respond)\n    Committed multi-century SLR: much larger (~1-2m for 1.5°C scenario;\n    several meters if WAIS or GIS thresholds exceeded)"
    },
