      "text": "CONSEQUENCES:\n    100-year flood events become annual in many cities by 2050\n    Saltwater intrusion into coastal freshwater aquifers\n    Bangladesh, Pacific island nations, major deltas (Mekong, Ganges,\n    Nile, Mississippi): extreme exposure\n    US coastal assets at risk: ~$1 trillion (NOAA estimates)\n    Managed retreat vs adaptation cost trade-off already active\n    (Miami: pumped elevation; Rotterdam: engineered surge barriers)\n```"
