      },
      "text": "WHERE THIS THRESHOLD HAS BEEN REACHED (as of 2023):\n    Persian Gulf: Tw > 35°C events recorded since 2015\n    South Asia: brief events in Rajasthan, Pakistan\n    At +2°C global: modeled to affect hundreds of millions/year\n    At +4°C: large parts of tropics uninhabitable during summer"
