      "text": "COMPOUND HEAT-HUMIDITY:\n    Humidity matters more than temperature alone\n    40°C (104°F) dry heat: survivable with shade/water\n    35°C (95°F) at 75% RH: at or near physiological limit\n    Urban heat island amplifies by 2-5°C vs rural surroundings"
