      "text": "HEAT MORTALITY:\n    2003 European Heatwave: ~70,000 excess deaths in 2 weeks\n      France: 15,000 (hospitals overwhelmed; August vacation)\n      Spain, Italy, UK, Germany: similar\n      Attribution: this event 2× more likely due to climate change\n    2021 Pacific Northwest Event: Lytton BC = 49.6°C (121°F)\n      ~1,400 excess deaths in Canada + NW US\n      Event would have been \"virtually impossible\" without\n      climate change (World Weather Attribution)"
