      "text": "ATTRIBUTION SCIENCE:\n    World Weather Attribution (WWA): rapid studies of whether\n    specific events made more likely/intense by climate change\n    Method: compare observed event in real-world climate model\n    vs counterfactual model without anthropogenic forcing\n    Key finding: virtually all major heat events now more likely;\n    many events essentially impossible in pre-industrial climate\n```"
